OL,3,GNEWSA'Still can't get a chance' after
OL,4,A100-plus applications
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who wants to become an
OL,7,Felectrician said he had applied for
OL,8,Fmore than 100 apprenticeships without
OL,9,Fany success.
OL,11,FDawud Hussain, who is studying
OL,12,Felectrical installation at Tameside
OL,13,FCollege in Greater Manchester, and also
OL,14,Fworks in a barbershop, said most
OL,15,Femployers did not even respond to his
OL,16,Fapplications.
