OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Still can't get a chance' after
OL,4,A100-plus applications
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 18-year-old spoke to BBC Radio
OL,7,FManchester as a major
OL,8,Fgovernment-commissioned review set out
OL,9,Frecommendations for reducing the number
OL,10,Fof Neets (young people who are not in
OL,11,Feducation, employment or training).
OL,13,FCity region mayor Bev Craig wants more
OL,14,Fpowers to tackle youth unemployment,
OL,15,Fincluding plans for a new
OL,16,Fapprenticeships hub to double the
OL,17,Fnumber available.
